---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Search from '../components/Search.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cari artikel — TeknoPulse"
  description="Cari artikel TeknoPulse berdasarkan kata kunci, judul, atau topik di seluruh arsip."
  showBreadcrumbs={false}
>
  <main>
    <header class="border-b-2 border-rule-strong">
      <div class="wrap pt-8 pb-7 sm:pt-12">
        <p class="kicker text-cobalt">Pencarian / seluruh arsip</p>
        <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
          <h1
            class="font-serif text-[clamp(3.4rem,9vw,7rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-headline"
          >
            Cari<span class="text-cobalt">.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="max-w-sm pb-2 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-ink-soft">
            Telusuri judul, ringkasan, dan isi artikel. Indeks pencarian dibangun dari seluruh
            artikel yang sudah terbit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="wrap grid gap-12 py-10 sm:py-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-0">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 lg:pr-12">
        <Search />
      </div>

      <aside class="lg:col-span-4 lg:border-l lg:border-rule lg:pl-10">
        <section aria-labelledby="mulai-dari">
          <h2
            id="mulai-dari"
            class="border-b-2 border-rule-strong pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold"
          >
            Mulai dari
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-2 divide-y divide-rule">
            <li>
              <a
                href="/posts/"
                class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-sm hover:text-cobalt"
              >
                <span>Arsip lengkap</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a
                href="/category/"
                class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-sm hover:text-cobalt"
              >
                <span>Semua rubrik</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a
                href="/tags/"
                class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-sm hover:text-cobalt"
              >
                <span>Indeks topik</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-8 border-t border-rule pt-5" aria-labelledby="tips-cari">
          <h2 id="tips-cari" class="kicker text-ink-muted">Tips mencari</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            <li>Gunakan kata kunci spesifik, misalnya nama produk atau model AI.</li>
            <li>Pencarian mencocokkan judul, ringkasan, dan isi artikel.</li>
            <li>
              Untuk menelusuri per rubrik, buka <a href="/category/" class="text-cobalt">Rubrik</a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <noscript>
          <p class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-cobalt pl-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">
            Pencarian memerlukan JavaScript. Anda tetap bisa menelusuri arsip lewat tautan rubrik di
            atas.
          </p>
        </noscript>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
